               <title>Other information</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>■Read all information on package before use.
  <br/>
■Save the box. Contains important information.
  <br/>
■Store at controlled room temperature 20-25°C (68-77°F).
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250328"/>
            </section>
